Description: Motif-Image-6B-Preview model weights for tt-local-generator
 Downloads Motif-Technologies/Motif-Image-6B-Preview from HuggingFace.
 Required for the Motif image generation mode (P300X2 hardware, 2×2 mesh).
 Status: complete in tt-inference-server v0.17.0.
 .
 The model is publicly available; a HuggingFace account is not required,
 though providing a token avoids API rate limits.
